  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là khoảng cách từ hải đăng đến bờ biển.<br>Ta có \n\t\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>55</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>125</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>55</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/7fd37efcc451f819aa28f4895cecc0ce1eea7a5fa0865f699d39497d34f33764.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\n\t\tÁp dụng định lí sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http:/